   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">If you suspect this kind of linear relationships, from simple to complex, I guess I would go with PCA on my columns.<div>PCA analysis would not only turn your columns into linearly uncorrelated combinations of columns, but might also show you &quot;underlying&quot; structures in your data.</div></div>"
    ],
    [
