   "subject": "Re: [Israel RUG] עמודות תלויות לינארית",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"rtl\">ניסית את זה?</div><div dir=\"rtl\"><a href=\"http://www.inside-r.org/packages/cran/cape/docs/get.linearly.independent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.inside-r.org/packages/cran/cape/docs/get.linearly.independent&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497725917000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2llAs2CF2URMIcuNgxZmVL\">http://www.inside-r.org/packages/cran/cape/docs/get.linearly.independent</a><br></div><div dir=\"rtl\"><br></div><div dir=\"rtl\">חוץ מזה, הניחוש שלי זה שאתה יכול לחשב rank למטריצה המלאה, ואז להעיף כל עמודה שלא משפיעה על ה- rank, עד שאתה מגיע למספר עמודות כגודל ה- rank. </div><div dir=\"rtl\"><br></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Tue, Oct 21, 2014 at 9:41 AM, Giora Simchoni <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">gsim...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">If you suspect this kind of linear relationships, from simple to complex, I guess I would go with PCA on my columns.<div>PCA analysis would not only turn your columns into linearly uncorrelated combinations of columns, but might also show you &quot;underlying&quot; structures in your data.<span><br><br>On Tuesday, 21 October 2014 14:55:29 UTC+3, Jonathan Schwartz  wrote:</span><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><span><div dir=\"ltr\">Thank you Giora,<div><br></div><div>But this works only for pairwise, what if 2 columns span the third for example?</div><div><br></div><div>Yoni</div></div></span><div><div><div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Tue, Oct 21, 2014 at 2:49 PM, Giora Simchoni <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">gsim...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;border-right:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex;padding-right:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Yoni,<div><br></div><div>For finding pairwise correlated columns above a certain threshold (e.g. 0.99), lookup:</div><div>caret::findCorrelation</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"http://www.inside-r.org/packages/cran/caret/docs/findCorrelation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.inside-r.org/packages/cran/caret/docs/findCorrelation&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497725917000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0WlW139vadLpxN67nMXerZ\">http://www.inside-r.org/<u></u>packages/cran/caret/docs/<u></u>findCorrelation</a></div><div><br></div><div>Thanks,</div><div><br></div><div>Giora.</div><div><span><br><br>On Tuesday, 21 October 2014 12:42:15 UTC+3, Amit Gal  wrote:</span><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><span><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"rtl\">זה קצת לא מוגדר היטב.... אם כבר, בד&quot;כ מחפשים קבוצה מקסימלית בלתי תלויה, ואז כל וקטור נוסף, תלוי לינארית.<br></div></div></span><span><div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Tue, Oct 21, 2014 at 12:32 PM, Jonathan Schwartz <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">yoni.sch...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;border-right:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex;padding-right:1ex\"><div dir=\"rtl\">מישהו מכיר פונקציה שיכולה למצוא איזה עמודות תליות לינארית במטריצה?</div><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;Israel R User Group&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a rel=\"nofollow\">israel-r-user-group+<u></u>unsubscrib<u></u>e...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497725917000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1z2PBQ6M9aWYo9P5-lQyun\">https://groups.google.com/d/<u></u>op<u></u>tout</a>.<br>\r\n</font></span></blockquote></div><br></div>\r\n</span></blockquote></div></div><div><div>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to a topic in the Google Groups &quot;Israel R User Group&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this topic, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/topic/israel-r-user-group/3WQrdzE-DJg/unsubscribe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/topic/israel-r-user-group/3WQrdzE-DJg/unsubscribe&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497725917000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1B7YNzTL-YEH5C9efJZc